    "updated_at": "2024-11-21T16:51:57Z",
    "body": "Devices that just use the default FTDI vendor and product IDs are so common that we're not able to distinguish between Topaz signature pads and blood glucose meters:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47629845-5df1-48b4-a398-2f07290e6754)\r\n\r\nIf filtering is a big lift for now, could we maybe consider just displaying the serial number in the device picker so that there's at least some way to distinguish between FTDI devices?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
