    "updated_at": "2026-10-30T09:11:23Z",
    "body": "This issue was raised at Media for WoT session at TPAC 2026. Two robots connected over WebSerial cannot be easily distinguished using available identifiers, there should be some way to identify specific devices. For instance, a serial number or a randomly-generated unique identifier like [BluetoothDevice.id](https://bluetooth.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-bluetoothdevice-id). The identification issue makes it difficult to configure unique behaviors for each connected robot.",
